TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu yanlışlıkla bana postalandı.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Üstünde
