{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Eh bien{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} En fait, j'aurais besoin de
